cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fourier in your research or software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Fourier: Spectrum Analysis and Spectrogram Visualization for VCV Rack"
abstract: >-
  Fourier is an Arhythmetic Units plugin for VCV Rack containing the Fourier
  spectrum analyzer and Spectre spectrogram visualizer. It provides incremental
  Fourier transforms, window functions, time and frequency smoothing, and
  reusable C++ digital signal processing components.
authors:
