date-released: "2025-04-14"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - digital signal processing
  - spectrum analysis
  - spectrogram
  - fast Fourier transform
  - short-time Fourier transform
  - modular synthesis
  - VCV Rack
  - C++
